OL,3,ASharp rise in sales of essential goods
OL,4,Aafter government call to stock up
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome retailers have seen a dramatic
OL,7,Fincrease in sales of essential goods
OL,8,Fafter the government called for people
OL,9,Fto stock up in case of a crisis,
OL,10,Faccording to figures obtained by
OL,11,FNewsnight.
OL,13,FThe Iceland supermarket chain said it
OL,14,Fwas "clear" consumers had listened to
OL,15,Fwarnings after it saw a 40% increase in
OL,16,Fsales of tinned products over the
OL,17,Fweekend.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
