OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASharp rise in sales of essential goods
OL,4,Aafter government call to stock up
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe rise in sales came after Defence
OL,7,FSecretary Wes Streeting said that
OL,8,Fpeople should stockpile goods to
OL,9,Fprepare for an emergency such as a
OL,10,Fcyber attack or an extreme weather
OL,11,Fevent.
OL,13,FRobert Dyas reported a 160% increase in
OL,14,Fsales of radios compared with last
OL,15,Fweek, while Maplin said sales had
OL,16,Fincreased by 92% in radios, 284% in
OL,17,Ftorches and 106% in power banks.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
